by `run-in-vm.sh \u003clab\u003e capture`.\\012- `.gitignore` for binaries and build outputs. Never commit a binary, a VM image, or a disk file; download images in a `make fetch` step instead.\\012- Root-only steps (`sudo` for SCHED_DEADLINE, tc, unshare, KSM sysfs) are explicit in the Makefile and README.\\012\\012Lab scope: lab-11: ping and iperf3 over the loopback and a veth pair, `tc netem` delay and loss injection, marshaling cost (struct.pack versus JSON versus protobuf), and a capsule-routing simulator.\\012\\012Lessons it serves: L05d (read those lesson notes under 01-CS-Foundations/Operating-Systems/AOS for vocabulary).\\012\\012Run inside the VM with 01-CS-Foundations/Operating-Systems/AOS/labs/setup/run-in-vm.sh 01-CS-Foundations/Operating-Systems/AOS/labs/lab-11-network-latency test, then capture real output with ... capture. make test must pass. --model gemini-3.1-pro-high --dangerously-skip-permissions --output-format stream-json\r\nshreejitverma     4373   0.0  0.0 463537424    176 s013  RN+   2:44PM   0:00.00 grep iperf3\r\nshreejitverma     4371   0.0  0.0 488787392   3216 s013  SNs+  2:44PM   0:00.01 zsh -c ps aux | grep iperf3\r\n"}}}
